<% content_for :title, "Music Region List" %>

<div class="space-y-8">
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">A soundtrack that follows the map</h1>
    <p class="max-w-prose text-neutral-400">
      Denmark's 98 kommuner each get an artist from a playlist you choose. As you drive,
      the next track is queued from whichever artist owns the region you are in — so the
      music changes when you cross a border.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rounded-lg border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/50 p-6">
    <%= button_to spotify_auth_path, method: :get,
          class: "rounded-full bg-emerald-500 px-6 py-3 font-medium text-neutral-950 hover:bg-emerald-400" do %>
      Connect Spotify
    <% end %>

    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-neutral-500">
      Requires Spotify Premium — the playback queue API does not work without it.
      Your phone keeps playing the music; this app only decides what goes into the queue.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
